<includeonly>{{#invoke:Kit|infobox}}</includeonly><noinclude>
A general information box for characters, places, factions, events or anything else.

<pre>
{{Infobox
|title=Elder Morwen
|subtitle=Keeper of the Ember Codex
|header1=Details
|label1=Race|data1=Human
|label2=Location|data2=[[Ashen Library]]
|header3=Combat
|label3=Hostile|data3=No
|theme=ember
}}
</pre>

Rows go up to 40 (<code>label40</code>, <code>data40</code>, <code>header40</code>). A row with data but no label spans the full width.

'''Result:'''

{{Infobox
|title=Elder Morwen
|subtitle=Keeper of the Ember Codex
|header1=Details
|label1=Race|data1=Human
|label2=Location|data2=[[Ashen Library]]
|header3=Combat
|label3=Hostile|data3=No
|theme=ember
}}


